# Appended to the VPS's /etc/caddy/Caddyfile on 2026-08-27, alongside the
# pre-existing tinyhumans.llmclouds.au block (unrelated, different project).
# Needs a DNS A record (assistant.llmclouds.au -> 103.108.228.3) before Caddy
# can obtain a cert — added manually via the registrar, not automatable from here.
#
# This site is the O1 Google OAuth relay (docs/oauth-relay.md): Custom Tab
# start, /oauth/google/callback (must match the GCP authorized redirect URI),
# token store, and (today) /v1/chat for Calendar/Gmail tool execution.

assistant.llmclouds.au {
	reverse_proxy localhost:8090
}
